  "limitations": [
    "Forward-only: FPL's API serves only current-season picks, so 2024-25/2025-26 cannot be rank-scored.",
    "estimated_rank is a band-weighted sample projection, not an official FPL figure: rivals are Horvitz-Thompson-weighted by their slice of the rank axis, and the unsampled tail below the deepest band is modelled with that band's score distribution (conservative -- real tail managers score worse than the rivals standing in for them).",
